48779057397", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75435284_2177448782390730_428727588116910256_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l-tQdfIa7W8Q7kNvwEgknGi&_nc_oc=Adk75uFYDikHU3ARXIBotwYPrQba8-09vB39y_VRVe_HEa81uoO5U0tCnAOv2iymUCc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfupKVDetfXKGWInmy9P4q7__5pPIujT_hP-brzY1TkIEA&oe=699C5666"}, {"file_name": "SDTool01.png", "id": "1281429298906003", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75340705_1281429302239336_4781847839353527208_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RLBWlWNnL8AQ7kNvwFI-wBk&_nc_oc=Adm8ilO45pVK7q8rZYbg6BG-E3qZM08EQbCuxESfUySGapsa5FfeWQZ5hSF4LjfwCTo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuk9_O0A6uM0wZmqW3pWNdehgokXHvAaAiBRvLP-2QuTg&oe=699C4FC4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Drops Training", "keywords": [], "long_description": "DROPS VR is an initiative by the DROPS Asia Chapter administered by Drilling VR to create a free Virtual Reality based awareness training and collaboration tool.\n\nStudents will learn through a series of real world simulated assignments to\n\n - Understand the potential of dropped objects\n - Recognize common causes of dropped objects\n - Methods for preventing dropped objects and preventing harm\n - Become familiar with reference tools and publications of the DROPS Forum\n\nDROPS is all about collaboration and the DROPS VR will be a tool where members can\n\n - Virtually remotely meet in a range of Industrial simulated environments\n - Interact with the Virtual Environment by pointing at and moving objects\n - Speak with each other through a multiplayer avatar system\n - Designed for subject matter experts to meet and collaborate for the prevention of dropped objects", "short_description": "Virtual Reality environment to learn about dropped object prevention."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dropsvr.org/privacy/"